# Build context of deploy/images/ui.Dockerfile, which is the repository root. BuildKit reads this
# file instead of a .dockerignore at the root.
#
# Only the UI sources and the nginx configuration get in. node_modules and dist stay out; .env,
# secrets, docs and the Python code never enter the context.
*
!apps/ui
!deploy/images/nginx/ui.conf
apps/ui/node_modules
apps/ui/dist
**/node_modules
**/.env
**/.env.*
